    "bookid": 67,
    "chapterId": 95,
    "fileId": 37104,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Parafibromin-deficient parathyroid tumour",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "It is emphasized that for parafibromin immunohistochemistry to be considered negative, there should be an internal positive control in non-neoplastic cells including non-neoplastic parathyroid tissue.",
